                               INSTALLATION
                               ============

One have to install some software. Following dependencies can be obtained
from package manager or their official site.

    1) git (https://git-scm.com/);
    2) NodeJS (https://nodejs.org/);

To deploy the frontend one should follow these steps:

    1) Clone the repository:
        $ git clone https://github.com/gdcdec/weblab6

    2) Jump to frontend directory:
        $ cd weblab6/frontend

    3) Install Yarn globally:
        $ npm install --global yarn

    4) Intall all dependencies specified in 'package.json':
        $ yarn install

    5) Create '.env' file inside backend directory:

        VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000


                                   USAGE
                                   =====

1. Compile the TypeScript code:
    $ yarn build

2.  Run server:
    $ yarn dev

3. Clean all dependencies:
    $ yarn clean


                                 WHAT WORK
                                 =========

- Registration
- Authorization
- Creation of new events


                             WHAT DOESN'T WORK
                             =================

- Deletion of events
- Sorting of events by date
